     .whnz2-testi-info h4 {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            margin-bottom: 2px;\n        }\n        .whnz2-testi-info span {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #0CC0DF;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .whnz2-testi-card p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #5a6478;\n            font-size: 14.5px;\n        }\n\n        .whnz2-faq-wrap {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #eaedf3;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-item summary {\n            padding: 20px 25px;\n            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #0a0f1e;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            list-style: none;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-item summary::after {\n            content: '\u2304';\n            color: #8a94a6;\n            font-size: 20px;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-item[open] summary::after {\n            transform: rotate(180deg);\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-content {\n            padding: 0 25px 20px;\n            color: #5a6478;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            border-top: 1px solid transparent;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .whnz2-faq-item[open] .whnz2-faq-content {\n            border-top: 1px solid #eaedf3;\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 RESPONSIVE \u2500\u2500 */\n        @media (max-width: 900px) {\n            .whnz2-banner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 40px 30px; }\n            .whnz2-checklist { text-align: left; }\n            .whnz2-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .whnz2-comp-card { padding: 30px 20px; }\n            .whnz2-sec-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .whnz2-sec-banner { flex-direction: column; text-align: left; padding: 30px; }\n            .whnz2-sec-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .whnz2-testi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            .whnz2-container, .whnz2-migrate-wrapper, .whnz2-security-wrapper { padding: 60px 20px; }\n            .whnz2-grid-4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .whnz2-banner-wrapper { padding: 20px; }\n            .whnz2-checklist { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .whnz2-comp-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }\n            .whnz2-comp-row .header { display: none; }\n            .whnz2-comp-val { text-align: right; }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <div class=\"whnz2-wrap\">\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-center-head whnz2-animate\">\n                <span class=\"whnz2-eyebrow\">WHO IS WEBHOSTING.CO.NZ FOR?</span>\n                <h2>NZ Hosting Solutions for Every Kiwi Website</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"whnz2-grid-4 whnz2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sol-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sol-ico\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H8a4 4 0 00-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Personal Websites & Blogs</h4>\n                    <p>Whether you want to share your story, build a portfolio, or start a side project, our entry plans are built for personal websites. Simple setup, free SSL, and a website builder to get you started fast.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"whnz2-sol-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sol-ico\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V6l-3-4z\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 01-8 0\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Small Business & eCommerce</h4>\n                    <p>New Zealand businesses need a reliable online presence to compete. Our hosting service handles ecommerce sites, product catalogues, booking systems and everything in between.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sol-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sol-ico\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 000 20 14.5 14.5 0 000-20\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Agencies & Web Designers</h4>\n                    <p>Managing multiple client sites? Our web hosting plan supports multiple domains, staging environments and easy cPanel access \u2014 everything you need to host a website for every client.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sol-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sol-ico\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Startups & New Websites</h4>\n                    <p>Looking to host your first website? We make it easy. Register your domain, choose your web hosting plan, install WordPress in one click, and display your website to the world.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"whnz2-banner-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-banner whnz2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-banner-text\">\n                    <h3>One-Click Install for Every Major Platform</h3>\n                    <p>All shared hosting plans include a 1-click install for WordPress, Joomla and Drupal \u2014 so your new website is live in minutes. Our website builder is also available for those who want to get online without writing a single line of code.</p>\n                    <ul class=\"whnz2-checklist\">\n                        <li>cPanel dashboard</li>\n                        <li>Free SSL certificate</li>\n                        <li>Regular backups</li>\n                        <li>Unlimited bandwidth</li>\n                        <li>eCommerce-ready</li>\n                        <li>24/7 monitoring</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnz2-banner-action\">\n                    <a href=\"#hosting-plans\" class=\"whnz2-btn-dark\">VIEW ALL HOSTING PLANS</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-container whnz2-partners whnz2-animate\">\n            <h3>Our Global Partners</h3>\n            <p>We work with Google Cloud, AWS, DigitalOcean, Cloudflare and MalCare to deliver world-class stability, speed and security \u2014 backed by the most trusted names in infrastructure.</p>\n            <div class=\"whnz2-partners-row\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-partner-pill\">GOOGLE CLOUD</div>\n                <div class=\"whnz2-partner-pill\">AWS</div>\n                <div class=\"whnz2-partner-pill\">DIGITALOCEAN</div>\n                <div class=\"whnz2-partner-pill\">CLOUDFLARE</div>\n                <div class=\"whnz2-partner-pill\">MALCARE</div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-migrate-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-grid-2 whnz2-animate\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2026/02/Untitled-design-84.webp\" alt=\"Migrate to WebHosting NZ\" class=\"whnz2-migrate-img\">\n                \n                <div class=\"whnz2-migrate-text\">\n                    <h2>Migrate in Minutes \u2014<br>Not Days</h2>\n                    <p>Already with another provider? Moving to WebHosting.co.nz is free and straightforward. Our one-click migration tool moves your websites, databases and emails automatically \u2014 with zero downtime and no risk of data loss.</p>\n                    \n                    <ul class=\"whnz2-migrate-list\">\n                        <li>No limits. No cost.</li>\n                        <li>Your existing site is preserved exactly as-is.</li>\n                        <li>Move your websites, databases and emails automatically</li>\n                        <li>Zero downtime and no risk of data loss</li>\n                    </ul>\n\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"whnz2-btn\">START YOUR FREE MIGRATION</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-white-sec\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-container whnz2-grid-2\" style=\"padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-perf-left whnz2-animate\">\n                    <span class=\"whnz2-eyebrow\">PERFORMANCE THAT MOVES AT KIWI SPEED</span>\n                    <h2>Fast Page Load Times.<br>Better Rankings.<br>More Conversions.</h2>\n                    <p>Page speed is a direct SEO ranking factor. Search engines reward faster loading sites with higher positions \u2014 and faster sites convert more visitors to your website into paying customers.</p>\n                    <p>Our based servers are optimised at every layer: SSD storage, edge caching, CDN, object caching and bot mitigation all work together to deliver fast page response times across New Zealand and globally.</p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"whnz2-case-study\">\n                        <h4><i>\u2197</i> Case Study: 71% Faster</h4>\n                        <p>\"A Wellington-based retail client migrated to WebHosting.co.nz from a US-based provider. Within two weeks, their average page load time dropped from 3.8 seconds to under 1.1 seconds \u2014 a 71% improvement that directly improved their Google rankings and reduced their bounce rate by 34%.\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-perf-right whnz2-animate\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-comp-card\">\n                        <h3>NZ-Based Hosting vs Offshore</h3>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"whnz2-comp-row header\">\n                            <span>FACTOR</span>\n                            <span>OFFSHORE HOSTING</span>\n                            <span style=\"color: #0CC0DF;\">WEBHOSTING.CO.NZ</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"whnz2-comp-row\">\n                            <span>Average TTFB (NZ users)</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val\">400\u2013900ms</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val highlight\">80\u2013150ms</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"whnz2-comp-row\">\n                            <span>Latency for NZ visitors</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val\">High</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val highlight\">Low</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"whnz2-comp-row\">\n                            <span>CDN included</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val\">Often extra cost</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val highlight\">Free</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"whnz2-comp-row\">\n                            <span>Support timezone</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val\">Mismatched</span>\n                            <span class=\"whnz2-comp-val highlight\">NZ-aligned</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"whnz2-anim-container\">\n                            <div id=\"whnz2-speedometer\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <a href=\"#hosting-plans\" class=\"whnz2-btn\">VIEW HOSTING PLANS</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-security-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-center-head whnz2-animate\" style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n                <span class=\"whnz2-eyebrow\">SECURITY YOU CAN COUNT ON</span>\n                <h2>Keep Your Website Safe \u2014 Every Day, Every Night</h2>\n                <p style=\"color: #5a6478; max-width: 650px; margin: 15px auto 0;\">A single hacker attack or phishing incident can destroy customer trust overnight. We take website security seriously so you don't have to lose sleep over it.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"whnz2-sec-grid whnz2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sec-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sec-ico\">\n                        <svg><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Free SSL Certificate</h4>\n                    <p>All plans include a free SSL certificate that's automatically activated. SSL certificates encrypt all traffic between your website and your visitors \u2014 protecting payment information, login credentials and personal data.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sec-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sec-ico\">\n                        <svg><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><polyline points=\"9 12 11 14 15 10\"></polyline></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>SSL Certificate Coverage</h4>\n                    <p>Need to protect multiple subdomains? Our WordPress plans include wildcard SSL certificate coverage \u2014 one SSL certificate that covers your entire domain and all subdomains.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sec-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sec-ico\">\n                        <svg><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><polyline points=\"3 3 3 8 8 8\"></polyline></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Automatic Regular Backups</h4>\n                    <p>We run regular backups of your files and data so that if anything goes wrong \u2014 whether from a malicious bot, a software conflict or human error \u2014 you can restore your website quickly.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sec-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-sec-ico\">\n                        <svg><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h4>Hacker & Bot Defense</h4>\n                    <p>Our server-level security filters malicious bots and hacker attempts before they reach your site. We monitor for phishing patterns, brute-force attacks, and suspicious traffic 24/7.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"whnz2-sec-banner whnz2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-sec-banner-left\">\n                    <h3>Security at a Glance:</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"whnz2-sec-list\">\n                        <li><svg><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"9 12 12 15 16 9\"></polyline></svg> Free SSL on every plan</li>\n                        <li><svg><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"9 12 12 15 16 9\"></polyline></svg> Wildcard SSL available</li>\n                        <li><svg><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"9 12 12 15 16 9\"></polyline></svg> Automated daily backups</li>\n                        <li><svg><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"9 12 12 15 16 9\"></polyline></svg> Bot and hacker mitigation</li>\n                        <li><svg><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"9 12 12 15 16 9\"></polyline></svg> Phishing protection</li>\n                        <li><svg><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"9 12 12 15 16 9\"></polyline></svg> Malware scanning (MalCare)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <a href=\"#hosting-plans\" class=\"whnz2-btn-white\">GET PROTECTED TODAY</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-center-head whnz2-animate\">\n                <h2>What Our Clients are Saying</h2>\n                <p style=\"color: #5a6478; max-width: 600px; margin: 15px auto 0;\">See how businesses across New Zealand trust our hosting services for reliability, speed, and exceptional support. Here's what our clients have to say about their experience with Webhosting NZ.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"whnz2-testi-grid whnz2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnz2-testi-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-testi-user\">\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2025/11/1-1-e1763619574274.webp\" alt=\"Scott\" class=\"whnz2-testi-img\">\n                        <div class=\"whnz2-testi-info\">\n                            <h4>Scott Marphy</h4>\n                            <span>Small Business Owner</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\"Webhosting NZ has completely improved the performance of my website. The speed, uptime, and support are far better than any host I've used before. Their team is responsive and truly understands the needs of New Zealand businesses.\"</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-testi-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-testi-user\">\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2025/11/2-1-e1763619626837.webp\" alt=\"Jasmin\" class=\"whnz2-testi-img\">\n                        <div class=\"whnz2-testi-info\">\n                            <h4>Jasmin Ara</h4>\n                            <span>Fashion Store Owner</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\"WebHosting NZ boosted my store's speed and reliability instantly. Pages load faster, checkout runs smoother, and uptime has been flawless. Their support team is quick and genuinely helpful. This has made a real difference!\"</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnz2-testi-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-testi-user\">\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2025/11/3-1-e1763619686336.webp\" alt=\"Mark\" class=\"whnz2-testi-img\">\n                        <div class=\"whnz2-testi-info\">\n                            <h4>Mark Phillips</h4>\n                            <span>Web Designer</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p>\"As a web designer, performance matters \u2014 and WebHosting NZ delivers. My clients' sites run faster, deployments are smoother, and issues have dropped drastically. Their support is fast and knowledgeable.\"</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnz2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnz2-center-head whnz2-animate\">\n                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"whnz2-faq-wrap whnz2-animate\">\n                <details class=\"whnz2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary>What makes NZ web hosting provider different from offshore hosting?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-faq-content\">\n                        NZ web hosting company means your website files are stored on servers physically located in New Zealand \u2014 in our case, in Auckland. This dramatically reduces latency for NZ visitors, resulting in faster page loads, better user experience, and improved SEO rankings in local search results. Offshore servers based in the US or Australia add unnecessary distance to every request your visitors make, slowing your site down.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n                \n                <details class=\"whnz2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary>Do you offer free SSL certificates?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-faq-content\">\n                        Yes. Every WebHosting.co.nz hosting plan includes a free SSL certificate, automatically configured on your domain. This encrypts all data passing between your website and your visitors, keeps browsers from flagging your site as insecure, and is a confirmed SEO ranking signal. WordPress hosting plans include a wildcard SSL certificate that covers your main domain and all subdomains.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnz2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary>How reliable is your uptime?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-faq-content\">\n                        We guarantee 99.9% uptime across all hosting plans. Our Auckland data centre runs on enterprise-grade hardware with redundant power, continuous monitoring and automated failover. In real terms, 99.9% uptime means less than 9 hours of potential downtime per year \u2014 and in practice, our customers experience far less than that.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnz2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary>Can I migrate my existing website to WebHosting.co.nz?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-faq-content\">\n                        Yes, and it's completely free. Our one-click migration tool handles the entire process \u2014 moving your website files, databases and emails across automatically, with no downtime. The process typically takes minutes, not hours. Our support team is available to assist if you run into any questions along the way.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnz2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary>Which hosting plan is right for a small business?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnz2-faq-content\">\n                        Most New Zealand small businesses start with our Web Hosting plan (from NZ$4.49/month) or our WordPress Hosting plan (from NZ$5.99/month) depending on the platform they use. If you're running a WordPress site \u2014 especially an ecommerce store \u2014 the WordPress plan includes staging, backups, CDN and free SSL out of the box, making it the smarter choice for business needs. If you need to host multiple client sites or run a high-traffic store, our VPS plan offers the scalability and dedicated resources to grow.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    \n    \n    </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<footer data-elementor-type=\"footer\" data-elementor-id=\"4117\" class=\"elementor elementor-4117 elementor-location-footer\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-667e98d5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"667e98d5\" data-element_type=\"container\" da